  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC operations by the Islamic Republic of Iran Delegation(2026 Unaudited)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Iran, the ICRC promotes IHL and works with the authorities in Iran and Iraq to address the consequences of the 1980-1988 Iran-Iraq war, particularly the issue of missing persons. We work with the Iranian Red Crescent and maintain a logistics capacity to support ICRC operations in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
